[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27422.548, "timestamp": "07:37:02", "text": "寫一首詩，嗯，就寫快樂吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27424.788, "timestamp": "07:37:04", "text": "。嗯，那或許不是決心，但我想應該是熱情吧。我非常高興大家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27455.43, "timestamp": "07:37:35", "text": "願意幫我籌辦這個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27459.708, "timestamp": "07:37:39", "text": "節日。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27463.51, "timestamp": "07:37:43", "text": "啊，我等不及節日到了。突然聽起來有點像索里了。 Monka，你根本不應該那樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27466.23, "timestamp": "07:37:46", "text": "念我"}]